  "steps": [
    "Grill the tempeh thins for 3 mins or heat them on a pan. Cut them into small cubes and keep aside.",
    "⁠In a pan, add olive oil and 50ml coconut milk. Cook for 2 mins on low flame until it starts reducing a bit.",
    "⁠Add 1 tbsp thai curry paste and mix well until its well combined.",
    "⁠Add 100ml coconut milk and 100ml of water. Also add sugar/zero calorie sweetner.",
    "⁠Let it cook for 2-3 minutes and then add in your veggies and tempeh. Also add kafir lime leaves.",
    "⁠Cover and let it simmer on low flame for 20-25 mins. You can add a little more water if needed."
